  "implemented": [
    "Durable local server tickets fit BOTH account and protected-user availability, including retained remote reservations; no quota ceiling or fsync reduction.",
    "Local body intent and unused grant close commit atomically before I/O; ambiguous commit returns no writer permission and retains conservative debt.",
    "Server-origin DATA/protocol bodies have independent magic and MAC domains, with the same bounded geometry. Original client body format/domain remains unchanged.",
    "Client reception pins issuer store/run, account/user/folder/UIDVALIDITY, Noise session and record generation; server descriptors cannot register as remote client grant usage.",
